{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from classic \u201990s 2D and early 3D shooters, Xentra Station combines old-school action with modern gameplay and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a member of an elite emergency response team, sent to investigate a sudden communication blackout at Xentra Station on a distant planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll discover powerful suit upgrades, unlock unique abilities, and equip a wide arsenal of specialized weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is filled with hidden passages, secrets, and a diverse range of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Survive. Uncover the horrors of Xentra Station.<br><br>DEMO includes Prologue with 3 levels and is in late BETA state.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067970?t=1759511909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067970?t=1759511909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067970/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759511909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067970/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759511909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic alien 